<del></del></span> Best Elemental Shaman Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>There are only two good trinkets that come from raiding and those are the ones we want the most. As getting two raid trinkets can be hard, you will likely have to run Celestial Dungeon Trinkets or Relic of Yu'lon.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87175/essence-of-terror">
